# MediaTek MT6785 (Poco M5s / rosemary) modem: CCCI over CCIF.

config ROSEMARY_CCCI
	tristate "MediaTek MT6785 modem (CCCI over CCIF, Poco M5s)"
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK
	help
	  The MediaTek MT6785 has a second processor for the modem (MD1,
	  generation 6295) that the AP reaches only through the CCIF control
	  transport and the DPMAIF packet transport. This driver powers the
	  modem's MTCMOS domain, reads the memory layout the bootloader hands
	  over, restarts the modem, answers its boot handshakes and exposes its
	  channels: the AT port, the NVRAM file service, the RPC service and
	  the packet data netdevs.

	  Say M here for the Poco M5s port. If unsure, say N.
